ss&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e90922227f0d6256432274bf6a0f4592 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "るいさん https://x.com/iriamrui のイラストをお願いしたいです！\n\n（何を書いてもポリシー違反でキャンセルされるため極限まで削りました、不躾ですみません🙇）", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@2d0ne_/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e578228/uploads/origins/50998753-cb42-4693-8634-16fe225d3139?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a35e74b80f37405075d572eee49eb30", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6e578228/uploads/origins/50998753-cb42-4693-8634-16fe225d3139?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a35e74b80f37405075d572eee49eb30, https://si.imgix.net/6e578228/uploads/origins/50998753-cb42-4693-8634-16fe225d3139?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=969cc62f9b7778d2ee829ad19085c501 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6e578228/uploads/origins/50998753-cb42-4693-8634-16fe225d3139?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d6227598b67ebac0c8b36b50c5ace20 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵はとてもかわいいです！私の猫の女の子を描いてもらえませんか？\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1lI_pUVE6AdELrmqNsv39TyGks2eam9Ot/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@2d0ne_/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ddb716b8/uploads/origins/3036a601-631c-402e-ac98-f2dff8b6749c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f176d9fa9d53af306349bf8463d8d7c0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ddb716b8/uploads/origins/3036a601-631c-402e-ac98-f2dff8b6749c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f176d9fa9d53af306349bf8463d8d7c0, https://si.imgix.net/ddb716b8/uploads/origins/3036a601-631c-402e-ac98-f2dff8b6749c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bef6b639efc2eacc42a36d6b3961282e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ddb716b8/uploads/origins/3036a601-631c-402e-ac98-f2dff8b6749c?bg=%23fff&fm=we